## Optional services

* **ElevenLabs** (`scripts/tts_elevenlabs.py`) is an optional, user-supplied
  third-party API. No key, audio or account data ships with this repository, and
  generated voices are subject to ElevenLabs' own terms. If you do not want to
  use it, the engine renders fine with synthesized music and estimated timing.

